#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started using Qiskit with IBM Quantum hardware in this Hello World example"
msgstr "Mulai menggunakan Qiskit dengan perangkat keras IBM Quantum dalam contoh Hello World ini"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run your first circuit on hardware"
msgstr "Jalankan circuit pertamamu di perangkat keras"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/hello-world.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/hello-world.ipynb\" />\n"

